The manuals to install and run are simple but it feels like its too simple, maybe i'm overthinking the whole thing............

Still recovering financially from the headache my ISP caused last month. We were out of internet for a little over 2 weeks, causing me to miss a week of income and my GF to miss 2 weeks working from home.

&amp;#x200B;

Happy New Years means rent and other bills are due so just need to catch up on those and get back to normal. Paying back a total of $375, two payment made on on the 13th and the final on the 27th for $187.50 each payment.

&amp;#x200B;

Never even been a day late on a payment, I recognize the risk lenders take here and want to make sure I can be one of those borrowers who handles loans as they should be handled.
